# Redaction: find e-mail addresses and mark them (undoable), mark text by dragging and an
# area by drawing a box, restyle a mark, apply into a new file and check it: the addresses
# are gone from the new file, so search no longer finds them. Also the about box.
cursor on
key ctrl+k
type "About Pagebara" 300
key return
await dialog == settings 3000
move "amazynk.com" 150
# The first frame may not be drawn yet on a busy machine.
wait 500
screenshot 12-about.png
key escape
open "$SAMPLES/personal.pdf"
zoom 100 0
tool redact
assert tool == 6
call redact-find email
await redact.hits == 2 10000
assert redact.hits.text contains jane.doe@example.org
assert redact.hits.text contains j.doe@northwind.example
screenshot 12-hits.png
click "Mark all" 400
assert redact.marks == 2
assert undo == Mark 2 for redaction
key ctrl+z
assert redact.marks == 0
key ctrl+y
assert redact.marks == 2
# Drag across the phone number to mark it.
drag text 1 "+44" text-end 1 "0958" 600
assert redact.marks == 3
# Draw a box over the card number.
call redact-mode 1
drag page 1 60,214 page 1 320,240 600
assert redact.marks == 4
# Give the first mark an overlay text.
click annot 1 1 400
assert redact.has-mark == true
call redact-mark-style 0 "REDACTED"
assert undo == Change redaction mark
screenshot 12-marked.png
key escape
call redact-confirm
assert dialog == redactapply
screenshot 12-confirm.png
call redact-apply "$OUT/personal-redacted.pdf"
await dialog == redactreport 30000
assert redact.clean == true
assert file.exists:$OUT/personal-redacted.pdf == true
await title == personal-redacted.pdf 20000
screenshot 12-report.png
key escape
# The redacted file: no marks left, and the addresses cannot be found.
assert redact.marks == 0
assert page.text:1 contains Customer record
key ctrl+f
type "jane.doe" 400
await search.done == true 10000
assert search.hits == 0
key escape
key ctrl+f
type "4111" 400
await search.done == true 10000
assert search.hits == 0
key escape
assert info:Author == ""
# The bookmark named an address: it is replaced there too.
assert outline == 1
assert outline.text == Mail to [redacted]
screenshot 12-redacted.png
